sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant UI as Front Desk UI
    participant API as ASP.NET Core API
    participant CTRL as EncounterEligibilityController
    participant ORCH as IEligibilityOrchestrator
    participant ENG as IEligibilityEngine
    participant ENC as Encounter Repository
    participant PROV as AvailityEligibilityProvider
    participant BLOB as Payload Store (Blob)
    participant PARSE as Normalization Pipeline
    participant INT as Interpretation Service
    participant COB as COB Decision Engine

    UI->>API: POST /api/practices/{practiceId}/encounters/{encounterId}/eligibility:run
    API->>CTRL: Route + Body + CancellationToken

    CTRL->>CTRL: Extract tenantId, userId from JWT
    CTRL->>CTRL: Validate practiceId ∈ claims
    CTRL->>CTRL: Load TenantConfig (timeout)
    CTRL->>CTRL: Create linked CTS (request + tenant timeout)

    CTRL->>ORCH: RunBlockingAsync(EligibilityRunCommand)
    ORCH->>ENG: RunAsync(cmd)

    ENG->>ENG: Compute IdempotencyKey
    ENG->>ENC: Check for existing matching eligibility
    alt Existing eligibility found
        ENG-->>ORCH: Return cached result
        ORCH-->>CTRL: EligibilityRunResult
        CTRL-->>UI: 200 OK (cached)
    else New eligibility
        ENG->>ENC: Persist EligibilityCheck (Status=Running)

        %% A — Eligibility Execution
        ENG->>PROV: SendAsync(270 request)
        note right of PROV
            HttpClientFactory + Resilience
            • Retry w/ exponential backoff + jitter
            • Attempt timeout
            • Total request timeout
            • Circuit breaker
        end
        PROV-->>ENG: 271 response

        ENG->>BLOB: Save request payload
        ENG->>BLOB: Save response payload

        %% B — Parse & Normalize
        ENG->>PARSE: Parse + normalize 271
        PARSE-->>ENG: Canonical coverage lines

        %% C — Coverage Interpretation
        ENG->>INT: Build BenefitsSummary
        INT-->>ENG: BenefitsSummary

        %% D — COB Decision
        ENG->>COB: Decide primary/secondary coverage
        COB-->>ENG: CoverageDecision

        ENG->>ENC: Persist EligibilityCheck (Succeeded)
        ENG->>ENC: Persist CoverageDecision

        ENG-->>ORCH: EligibilityRunResult
        ORCH-->>CTRL: EligibilityRunResult
        CTRL-->>UI: 200 OK (final result)
    end